# Files that the sdist ships beyond the package itself.
#
# The tests are useful to anyone unpacking the sdist, but they import
# make_fixtures, so the whole tests/ tree has to travel together. The generated
# fixtures themselves are build products and are excluded — tests/make_fixtures.py
# rebuilds them byte for byte on demand.
graft tests
prune tests/fixtures
global-exclude *.py[cod] __pycache__

include README.zh-CN.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include NOTES-packing.md
include NOTES-dotnet.md
include RELEASING.md
